{
    "title": "Getaround",
    "description": "Rent cars by the hour, day or week and unlock them with the app. No subscription is needed. As the world's leading carsharing platform, Getaround boasts over 5 million users and more than 70,000 vehicles in over 300 cities.\r\n\r\nGetaround makes carsharing easy! Instantly rent and unlock great cars from your phone with the Getaround app.\r\n\r\nDrive confidently knowing comprehensive insurance covers every carsharing trip.\r\n\r\n\r\nChoose your perfect car safely:\r\n\r\nReliable and flexible, Getaround helps you rent a luxury car 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, without the time-consuming paperwork, queues and counters. Ideal for saving time when you're out of town for a few days.\r\n\r\nJoining is easy. Just download the app and start renting a wide variety of cars on our platform, from a Toyota to a Tesla, no subscription is required. Insurance is never a problem. Getaround offers multiple protection plans - or use your own insurance to save even more.\r\n\r\nA car for each need: family cars for vacations, vans for moving days, compact cars for city trips, luxury vehicles for business meetings, minibuses for road trips with friends, etc.\r\n\r\nUse Getaround for every occasion: weekend getaways, visiting friends, moving houses, business travel, city tours, shopping trips, road trips with friends, client meetings, etc.\r\n\r\nSelect your perfect car using filters by car type, equipment, number of seats and price.\r\n\r\nRent a car in just a few taps on Getaround app:\r\n\r\n1. Search for cars nearby\r\n2. Choose the one that fits your needs\r\n3. Rent it through the app\r\n4. Unlock/lock it with your smartphone\r\n5. Drop it off when done\r\n\r\nGetaround across the US:\r\n\r\nCar rental near you in the different states: Florida, California, Texas, Georgia, Illinois, Pennsylvania, etc.\r\nGetaround includes also car share in major cities & airports in San Francisco, Los Angeles, Boston, Chicago, Philadelphia, Atlanta, etc.\r\n\r\nGetaround across Europe:\r\n\r\n- France: Paris, Lyon, Bordeaux, Marseille, Toulouse, Montpellier, Nice, Avignon, A\u00e9roport Roissy-Charles de Gaulle, Paris Orly\r\n- Germany: Berlin, Berlin Tegel Airport, Hamburg, Munich, Stuttgart, Frankfurt\r\n- Spain: Barcelona, Barcelona El Prat Airport, Madrid, Madrid Barajas Airport\r\n- Belgium: Brussels, Antwerp\r\n- Austria: Vienna, Salzburg\r\n\r\n\r\nA carsharing experience trusted by millions of drivers:\r\n\r\n\u201cIt\u2019s significantly more affordable than conventional rental services, and I can find cars much closer to my location.\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cIncredible! Using Getaround is far better than dealing with rental agencies. It\u2019s fast and efficient.\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cI have been sharing my car via Getaround in San Francisco for over two years. It's incredibly straightforward.\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cThe commodity is unmatched. Unlocking the car with a smartphone works flawlessly.\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cGreat for renting cars. There are no surprise charges. It\u2019s also very accommodating for drivers from outside the EU with a valid international license.\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cThe ideal app for renting your car to others when it's not in use, and making extra cash.\u201d\r\n\r\n\"I needed a van for a move. It was much easier and cheaper than traditional rental methods.\"\r\n\r\n\r\nGetaround for Car Owners:\r\n\r\n- Earn up to $1000 by sharing your car to offset the high costs of car ownership\r\n- Rent out effortlessly using Getaround Connect technology\r\n- Manage your rentals easily directly through the app\r\n\u00a0\r\nHow it works?\r\n\u00a0\r\n1. List your car: enter key details about your vehicle, and we will contact you to schedule the installation of our device\r\n2. Receive bookings: once we verify their identity, drivers can reserve your car for the times you specify as available\r\n3. Renting made easy: drivers can find your car and use their phone to unlock it independently, or inspect and sign the contract directly with you\r\n4. Get paid: funds are transferred to your bank account within five working days after each rental\r\n\r\n\r\nGetaround for Businesses:\r\n\r\n- Pay with personal or business credit cards\r\n- Receipts available\r\n- Premium cars available for business appointments\r\n\r\nQuestions? Visit https://getaround.com/help for assistance",
    "descriptionHTML": "Rent cars by the hour, day or week and unlock them with the app. No subscription is needed. As the world&#39;s leading carsharing platform, Getaround boasts over 5 million users and more than 70,000 vehicles in over 300 cities.<br><br>Getaround makes carsharing easy! Instantly rent and unlock great cars from your phone with the Getaround app.<br><br>Drive confidently knowing comprehensive insurance covers every carsharing trip.<br><br><br>Choose your perfect car safely:<br><br>Reliable and flexible, Getaround helps you rent a luxury car 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, without the time-consuming paperwork, queues and counters. Ideal for saving time when you&#39;re out of town for a few days.<br><br>Joining is easy. Just download the app and start renting a wide variety of cars on our platform, from a Toyota to a Tesla, no subscription is required. Insurance is never a problem. Getaround offers multiple protection plans - or use your own insurance to save even more.<br><br>A car for each need: family cars for vacations, vans for moving days, compact cars for city trips, luxury vehicles for business meetings, minibuses for road trips with friends, etc.<br><br>Use Getaround for every occasion: weekend getaways, visiting friends, moving houses, business travel, city tours, shopping trips, road trips with friends, client meetings, etc.<br><br>Select your perfect car using filters by car type, equipment, number of seats and price.<br><br>Rent a car in just a few taps on Getaround app:<br><br>1. Search for cars nearby<br>2. Choose the one that fits your needs<br>3. Rent it through the app<br>4. Unlock/lock it with your smartphone<br>5. Drop it off when done<br><br>Getaround across the US:<br><br>Car rental near you in the different states: Florida, California, Texas, Georgia, Illinois, Pennsylvania, etc.<br>Getaround includes also car share in major cities &amp; airports in San Francisco, Los Angeles, Boston, Chicago, Philadelphia, Atlanta, etc.<br><br>Getaround across Europe:<br><br>- France: Paris, Lyon, Bordeaux, Marseille, Toulouse, Montpellier, Nice, Avignon, A\u00e9roport Roissy-Charles de Gaulle, Paris Orly<br>- Germany: Berlin, Berlin Tegel Airport, Hamburg, Munich, Stuttgart, Frankfurt<br>- Spain: Barcelona, Barcelona El Prat Airport, Madrid, Madrid Barajas Airport<br>- Belgium: Brussels, Antwerp<br>- Austria: Vienna, Salzburg<br><br><br>A carsharing experience trusted by millions of drivers:<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s significantly more affordable than conventional rental services, and I can find cars much closer to my location.\u201d<br><br>\u201cIncredible! Using Getaround is far better than dealing with rental agencies. It\u2019s fast and efficient.\u201d<br><br>\u201cI have been sharing my car via Getaround in San Francisco for over two years. It&#39;s incredibly straightforward.\u201d<br><br>\u201cThe commodity is unmatched. Unlocking the car with a smartphone works flawlessly.\u201d<br><br>\u201cGreat for renting cars. There are no surprise charges. It\u2019s also very accommodating for drivers from outside the EU with a valid international license.\u201d<br><br>\u201cThe ideal app for renting your car to others when it&#39;s not in use, and making extra cash.\u201d<br><br>&quot;I needed a van for a move. It was much easier and cheaper than traditional rental methods.&quot;<br><br><br>Getaround for Car Owners:<br><br>- Earn up to $1000 by sharing your car to offset the high costs of car ownership<br>- Rent out effortlessly using Getaround Connect technology<br>- Manage your rentals easily directly through the app<br>\u00a0<br>How it works?<br>\u00a0<br>1. List your car: enter key details about your vehicle, and we will contact you to schedule the installation of our device<br>2. Receive bookings: once we verify their identity, drivers can reserve your car for the times you specify as available<br>3. Renting made easy: drivers can find your car and use their phone to unlock it independently, or inspect and sign the contract directly with you<br>4. Get paid: funds are transferred to your bank account within five working days after each rental<br><br><br>Getaround for Businesses:<br><br>- Pay with personal or business credit cards<br>- Receipts available<br>- Premium cars available for business appointments<br><br>Questions? Visit https://getaround.com/help for assistance",
